{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54819","headline":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 十九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，忽见地生丹（京本作「忽有土崩塌」）。\n敌骑欲来冲突我，差人截路莫轻闲（京本作「待莫轻看」），移寨庶几安（辛本、川本作「倚亭关」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}